0w, https:\/\/filter.philitee.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/Belt-Filter-Cloth-03-main3_syy-100x100.jpg 100w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 600px) 100vw, 600px\" \/>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-db1d023 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"db1d023\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>Woven filter cloth is a material that can be used for filtration and separation, with a wide range of applications in various industries, including metallurgy, chemical, non-ferrous metal, food processing, and more. The fabric weave is how the warp and weft yarns are interlaced, The repeat is the smallest weave unit, when repeated, will produce the design required in the fabric.<\/p><h3>There are Three Basic Weaves\u00a0 for Belt Filter Cloth<\/h3>\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-f88c3ef e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"f88c3ef\" data-element_type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-b8b5409 elementor-widget__width-initial elementor-position-top elementor-widget elementor-widget-image-box\" data-id=\"b8b5409\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image-box.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-image-box-wrapper\"><figure class=\"elementor-image-box-img\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"358\" src=\"https:\/\/filter.philitee.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/Plain-Weave-detail4.jpg\" class=\"attachment-full size-full wp-image-2585\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https:\/\/filter.philitee.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/Plain-Weave-detail4.jpg 600w, https:\/\/filter.philitee.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/Plain-Weave-detail4-300x179.jpg 300w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 600px) 100vw, 600px\" \/><\/figure><div class=\"elementor-image-box-content\"><h3 class=\"elementor-image-box-title\">Plain Weave<\/h3><p class=\"elementor-image-box-description\">The plain weave is the simplest and the most used weave. Each warp yarn passes alternately over one and then under one weft yarn, Two adjacent warp yarns interlace the exact opposite, Therefore, the plain weave makes one repeat by two ends and two picks, There is only one plain weave, but there are many different twill and satin weaves. Unless colors is printed onto the surface, plain weave fabrics are generally considered to be reversible.<\/p><\/div><\/div>\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-46c7695 elementor-widget__width-initial elementor-position-top elementor-widget elementor-widget-image-box\" data-id=\"46c7695\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image-box.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-image-box-wrapper\"><figure class=\"elementor-image-box-img\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"344\" src=\"https:\/\/filter.philitee.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/Twill-Weave-detail5.jpg\" class=\"attachment-full size-full wp-image-2586\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https:\/\/filter.philitee.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/Twill-Weave-detail5.jpg 600w, https:\/\/filter.philitee.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/Twill-Weave-detail5-300x172.jpg 300w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 600px) 100vw, 600px\" \/><\/figure><div class=\"elementor-image-box-content\"><h3 class=\"elementor-image-box-title\">Twill Weave<\/h3><p class=\"elementor-image-box-description\">The twill weave is characterized by a diagonal line on the cloth . In a right hand twill, the diagonals run upward to the right. In a left hand twill, the lines run upward to the left. Filtration cloth for belt filter press yarns used in making twill weave fabrics frequently are tightly twisted and exhibit good strength, In general, twill weave fabrics are strong and durable.<\/p><\/div><\/div>\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-c8bb50b elementor-widget__width-initial elementor-position-top elementor-widget elementor-widget-image-box\" data-id=\"c8bb50b\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image-box.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-image-box-wrapper\"><figure class=\"elementor-image-box-img\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"366\" src=\"https:\/\/filter.philitee.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/Satin-Weave-detail6.jpg\" class=\"attachment-full size-full wp-image-2587\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https:\/\/filter.philitee.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/Satin-Weave-detail6.jpg 600w, https:\/\/filter.philitee.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/Satin-Weave-detail6-300x183.jpg 300w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 600px) 100vw, 600px\" \/><\/figure><div class=\"elementor-image-box-content\"><h3 class=\"elementor-image-box-title\">Satin Weave<\/h3><p class=\"elementor-image-box-description\">Satin weaves are characterized by having long floats of either warp or weft yarn and nonadjacent interlacing points. Filtration cloth for belt filter press the satin weave fabric has a smooth and lustrous surface, However, the long floats tend to be snagged and abraded easily, Thus, satin fabrics are not as durable as plain or twill weave fabrics.<\/p><\/div><\/div>\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-bd97420 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"bd97420\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h3>The Uniqueness of Filmedia\u00ae Belt Filter Cloth<\/h3><p>Our Double Layer Weave fabrics are designed for belts filter. Double weave technology combines fine filter fabric laminated with sturdy supporting fabric. Best filtration results and enhanced lifetime is achieved by combining the functions of a fine filtration layer and a support drainage layer. This concept is recognized as being the most successful standard for vacuum belt filters.<\/p><ul><li>Best permeability due to optimal fabric design.<\/li><li>Wide range of pore sizes (7-150 \u00b5m).<\/li><li>Optimum particle retention, due to special pore structure.<\/li><li>Excellent cake release, resulting from the special surface treatment of the fabrics.<\/li><\/ul>\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-8ecae7b e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"8ecae7b\" data-element_type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-d729040 elementor-widget__width-initial elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"d729040\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"570\" height=\"375\" src=\"https:\/\/filter.philitee.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/3-570x375-detail1.png\" class=\"attachment-large size-large wp-image-2589\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https:\/\/filter.philitee.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/3-570x375-detail1.png 570w, https:\/\/filter.philitee.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/3-570x375-detail1-300x197.png 300w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 570px) 100vw, 570px\" \/>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-4b14af2 elementor-widget__width-initial elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"4b14af2\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"570\" height=\"404\" src=\"https:\/\/filter.philitee.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/